sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Orchestrator as Saga Orchestrator
    participant OrderSvc as Order Service
    participant InventorySvc as Inventory Service
    participant SagaStore as Saga Store

    Note over Client,SagaStore: Successful Saga Flow

    Client->>Orchestrator: POST /process-order
    Orchestrator->>SagaStore: Create Saga Transaction
    SagaStore-->>Orchestrator: Saga ID created
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Orchestrator,OrderSvc: Step 1: CREATE_ORDER
        Orchestrator->>OrderSvc: Create Order (PENDING)
        OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: INSERT order with saga_id
        OrderSvc-->>Orchestrator: Order created ✓
        Orchestrator->>SagaStore: Update step status: COMPLETED
    end
    
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Orchestrator,InventorySvc: Step 2: RESERVE_INVENTORY
        Orchestrator->>InventorySvc: Reserve Inventory
        InventorySvc->>InventorySvc: Check availability
        InventorySvc->>InventorySvc: Create reservation
        InventorySvc->>InventorySvc: Reduce available stock
        InventorySvc-->>Orchestrator: Inventory reserved ✓
        Orchestrator->>SagaStore: Update step status: COMPLETED
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Orchestrator,OrderSvc: Step 3: CONFIRM_ORDER
        Orchestrator->>OrderSvc: Confirm Order
        OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: UPDATE status to CONFIRMED
        OrderSvc-->>Orchestrator: Order confirmed ✓
        Orchestrator->>SagaStore: Update step status: COMPLETED
    end
    
    rect rgb(248, 240, 255)
        Note over Orchestrator,InventorySvc: Step 4: CONFIRM_INVENTORY
        Orchestrator->>InventorySvc: Confirm Reservation
        InventorySvc->>InventorySvc: UPDATE reservation to CONFIRMED
        InventorySvc-->>Orchestrator: Reservation confirmed ✓
        Orchestrator->>SagaStore: Update step status: COMPLETED
    end
    
    Orchestrator->>SagaStore: Mark Saga as COMPLETED
    Orchestrator-->>Client: Success Response + Saga Details

    Note over Client,SagaStore: Failure Saga Flow with Compensation

    Client->>Orchestrator: POST /process-order (insufficient inventory)
    Orchestrator->>SagaStore: Create Saga Transaction
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Orchestrator,OrderSvc: Step 1: CREATE_ORDER
        Orchestrator->>OrderSvc: Create Order (PENDING)
        OrderSvc-->>Orchestrator: Order created ✓
        Orchestrator->>SagaStore: Update step status: COMPLETED
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over Orchestrator,InventorySvc: Step 2: RESERVE_INVENTORY (FAILS)
        Orchestrator->>InventorySvc: Reserve Inventory
        InventorySvc->>InventorySvc: Check availability
        InventorySvc-->>Orchestrator: Insufficient inventory ❌
        Orchestrator->>SagaStore: Update step status: FAILED
        Orchestrator->>SagaStore: Mark Saga as COMPENSATING
    end
    
    rect rgb(255, 255, 200)
        Note over Orchestrator,OrderSvc: Compensation: CANCEL_ORDER
        Orchestrator->>OrderSvc: Cancel Order
        OrderSvc->>OrderSvc: UPDATE status to CANCELLED
        OrderSvc-->>Orchestrator: Order cancelled ✓
        Orchestrator->>SagaStore: Update step status: COMPENSATED
    end
    
    Orchestrator->>SagaStore: Mark Saga as COMPENSATED
    Orchestrator-->>Client: Error Response + Compensation Details